<title>USA: Caldor names Feldberg chairman and CEO.</title>
<headline>Caldor names Feldberg chairman and CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caldor Corp said Friday that it has named Warren Feldberg chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Feldberg succeeds Don Clarke, who has decided to leave the company, having served as Caldor's chairman and chief executive officer since 1986.</p>
<p>Feldberg has served since May 1996 as the company's president, chief operating officer and a member of the board of directors.</p>
